<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Appointment Reminder - MediSetu</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .logo {
      max-width: 150px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .content {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .details {
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .meet-link {
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    .reminder {
      background-color: #fff3cd;
      border: 1px solid #ffeeba;
      color: #856404;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <img src="https://medisetu.com/logo.png" alt="MediSetu Logo" class="logo">
    <h1>Appointment Reminder</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <p>Dear {{userName}},</p>

    <div class="reminder">
      <p><strong>Reminder:</strong> You have an upcoming appointment with Dr. {{doctorName}}.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="details">
      <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{appointmentDate}}</p>
      <p><strong>Time:</strong> {{appointmentTime}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>Please join the video consultation using the link below:</p>
    <a href="{{meetLink}}" class="meet-link">Join Video Consultation</a>

    <p>Important Reminders:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Please join 5 minutes before your scheduled time</li>
      <li>Ensure you have a stable internet connection</li>
      <li>Keep your camera and microphone ready</li>
      <li>Have your medical reports handy if any</li>
      <li>If you need to reschedule, please do so at least 24 hours in advance</li>
    </ul>

    <p>If you have any questions or need to reschedule, please contact our support team.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    <p>For any queries, please contact our support team.</p>
    <p>&copy; 2024 MediSetu. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html> 